      "name": "[3] Illusory Booster Shot",
      "desc": "After successfully triggering <color=#FFAF2C>Blaze</color>, gains the following buff for 30s: Using a <color=#FFAF2C>Chain Takedown</color> or <color=#FFAF2C>EX Special Attack</color> will trigger a <color=#FFAF2C>Blaze</color> effect, which can be triggered once every 15s.\nAfter triggering <color=#FFAF2C>Lightning Counter</color>, gains the following buff for 18s: Any attack that hits an enemy will <color=#FFAF2C>trigger a lightning strike</color> to attack the enemy, which can be triggered once every 10s.\nAfter triggering <color=#FFAF2C>Miasma Quelling</color>, automatically restores <color=#FFAF2C>Decibels</color> and <color=#FFAF2C>Energy</color>, which can be triggered once every 20s.",
